  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound skinless, boneless chicken breast halves",
    "2 teaspoons vegetable oil",
    "1 tablespoon minced onion",
    "0.25 cup tomato sauce",
    "1 pinch ground cumin",
    "1 pinch chili powder"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/A12qyq7BnOQ4FswP9BYcKJflTCQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220326-Sarahs-easy-shredded-chicken-taco-filling-Step1-28534dc015b44acbafc0c9ce6c17285c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220326/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken breasts in a saucepan and cover with water. Bring to a boil over medium heat, then simmer until no longer pink, 10 to 12 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aYbewIFzXTpQhiGaauksuEicDwA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220326-Sarahs-easy-shredded-chicken-taco-filling-Step1-1-193c9e279c7445048e7dba66b7a6760c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220326/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer chicken breasts to a bowl. Allow to cool briefly, then shred with 2 forks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tdSmKkX98dE-plAbe2M5lyWrJ7Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220326-Sarahs-easy-shredded-chicken-taco-filling-Step3-5f44aefc69e94dad962b90006790f863.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220326/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat vegetable oil in a saucepan over medium heat. Add onion and cook until translucent, 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/g74ZUn5l4PttEaXyQ7SYei062IM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220326-Sarahs-easy-shredded-chicken-taco-filling-Step4-6d963c41f72a42e6baa198ef40a70754.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220326/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in shredded chicken, tomato sauce, cumin, and chili powder. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer until chicken is hot and flavors have blended, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TENEcM5wnfM2yVWty90ZNjobcAg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220326-Sarahs-easy-shredded-chicken-taco-filling-Step5-2c728d2387f14a8aa65b866fd3ea3146.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220326/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
